    "notes": "Windows only: correct Outlook attachment filenames for plain-text and HTML drafts across local, inline and chunked upload routes. Six live cases verified exact filename, PDF MIME and bytes using the freshly rebuilt packaged helper. Temporary drafts deleted; no sends. Invalid filenames rejected before attachment mutation. Unsigned preview; installation, upgrade and customer acceptance separate. Mac/Linux unchanged.",
